ial work of the council goes  on around them against all the odds the  700 year old house is alive again and  ready for another 700 years  but knit the last words be with  counseling miss lammott and the chief  executive of the cook at that memorable  opening ceremony the house ladies and  gentlemen is yours for only don't take  it away and I'm sure they never will
 

